cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite it using its concept DOI. If you also
  use the accompanying research data, cite the dataset separately as described
  in the README.
type: software
title: gas-trajectories-in-amorphous-media
abstract: >-
  Trajectory analysis of gas molecules in kerogen pore structures: trapping-event
  classification (distance-matrix, Neyman-Pearson, Bayesian and hybrid analyzers),
  pore-network-model statistics, and the synthetic benchmarks used to validate them.
version: 1.0.0
date-released: "2026-09-04"
